        "\n",
        "- 결과: $h_1 = [0.6, 0.0]$\n",
        "\n",
        "<br> 3단계: $F(x) = W_2 \\cdot h_1 + b_2$\n",
        "\n",
        "$$F(x) = \\begin{bmatrix} 0.6 & 0.1 \\\\ 0.2 & -0.5 \\end{bmatrix} \\cdot \\begin{bmatrix} 0.6 \\\\ 0.0 \\end{bmatrix} + \\begin{bmatrix} 0.0 \\\\ 0.0 \\end{bmatrix}$$\n",
